  "layers": "Draw shadow (ground, tint one step darker: core.SHADE), then body. On a hit swap body for flash for ~50 ms. In the finale draw only eyes (the ice pixels).",
  "directions": "it never moves: pick by where Wick is. front = Wick below (|dy| >= |dx|, dy > 0), back = Wick above, side = left/right (side faces right; mirror for left, axis = anchor x, negate emit.x). Switch only on a cycle boundary (idle frame 0) so it never pops.",
  "emit": "per frame: the cap's crown, anchor-relative (+x right, +y down); null when there is no cap",
  "release": "puff frame 0 (release: true): spawn the 8 spores at emit + spawn_radius, play puff_ring at emit",
  "altitude": "fall only: the falling seed's height above the landing spot (seed = its centre)",
  "animations_sold": "loops hold frame 0; every one-shot shows its frame 0 for its duration (swell frame 0 is already the tell). Exception: keep playing `fall` (it is the arrival's motion and its growing shadow is the tell).",
